        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mumwaka wamusanu aumwi, mumwezi wamusanu aumwi, mubuzuba bwasanu bwamumwezi, ndakalikede muŋanda yangu, abalo bapati ba-Juda kabakede kubusyu bwangu, nkabela ijanza lya-Mwami Jehova lyakandiwida mpoonya awo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
