        {
          "text": "Lino wakandinjizya mulubanza lwamukati lwaŋanda ya-Jehova, nkabela nkukonya oko kumulyango wantempele ya-Jehova, akatikati kalukonkono acipaililo, kwakabonwa bantu bakati be makumi obile amusanu bafutatide intempele ya-Jehova, balangide kujwe, balakomba izuba kujwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
